### Complete task
PATCH http://localhost:5187/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Verify
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks/2

### Missing task
PATCH http://localhost:5187/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}